# Keep the Docker build context small: never ship build artifacts or VCS state.
# Every target/, not only the root's: tools/mqttui is its own workspace and builds into
# tools/mqttui/target, which alone was ~570 MB of a ~600 MB context (now ~24 MB).
**/target/
.git/
**/*.redb
demo/grafana/data/
# Operator scratch (gitignored); never part of an image.
astra/
# Scale-rig results (gitignored, local only) and session worktrees: tens of GB that no
# image needs. Sending bench/scale/.runs (~20 GB) filled Docker's disk mid-build.
bench/scale/.runs/
.claude/
